Total:
    int[]: items
    return: int
    sum:
        int: result 0
        int: i 0
        while: i < length(items)
            result += items[i]
            i += 1
        return: result

Example:
    int: opening
    int[]: charges
    int[]: credits
    return: @
    run:
        int: charged Total\sum(charges)
        int: credited Total\sum(credits)
        return: (charged; credited; opening + charged - credited)
